            "text": "/*! *****************************************************************************\n                              这里是与设计对其的标准色盘\n注意：所有的颜色须从色盘中提取，不得擅自添加颜色。若设计师给出的UI稿中带有色盘中不存在的颜色，\n请与王坤联系并确认。\n***************************************************************************** */\n/*! **************************************\n        Naming Rule:\n          modules(BEM) + rule name\n\n        Example:\n          @main-container-bg\n*****************************************/.feature-guide{display:inline-block;margin-top:1px;position:relative}.feature-guide:after{background-color:var(--ccmtoken-doc-highlightcolor-red-solid);border-radius:50%;content:\" \";display:inline-block;font-size:0;height:5px;position:absolute;right:-5px;top:0;width:5px}.feature-guide.offset-20:after{right:30px;top:10px}.feature-guide.feature-guide-right-corner:after{right:-2px;top:-2px}\n\n/*! *****************************************************************************\n                              这里是与设计对其的标准色盘\n注意：所有的颜色须从色盘中提取，不得擅自添加颜色。若设计师给出的UI稿中带有色盘中不存在的颜色，\n请与王坤联系并确认。\n***************************************************************************** */\n/*! **************************************\n        Naming Rule:\n          modules(BEM) + rule name\n\n        Example:\n          @main-container-bg\n*****************************************/.innerdocbody.adit-container ul.r-list-done li{color:var(--text-caption)}.input-checkbox-checked-label-before{background-color:var(--B500-BG);background-size:100%;border:1px solid var(--text-link-hover)}.input-checkbox-checked-label{background-color:var(--bg-body);background-position:50%;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:0 0;border:1px solid var(--text-link-disabled);border-radius:4px;box-sizing:border-box;content:\"\";cursor:pointer;display:inline-block;height:16px;position:absolute;transition:all .1s ease-in;width:16px}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3{overflow:auto}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.adapt-size-hoder{max-height:calc(100vh - 80px)}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.adapt-size-hoder-pad{max-height:80vh}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.adapt-size-hoder-card-mode{max-height:calc(100vh - 161px)}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-divider{flex-shrink:0}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.moremenu-wrapper.ud__menu-normal .ud__menu-normal-submenu-title,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.ud__menu-normal-submenu .ud__menu-normal-submenu-title{height:32px;min-height:28px}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.moremenu-wrapper.ud__menu-normal .ud__menu-normal-submenu-title .navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.ud__menu-normal-submenu .ud__menu-normal-submenu-title .navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item{align-items:center;display:flex}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.moremenu-wrapper.ud__menu-normal.ud__menu-normal-submenu-disabled .navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item__icon svg path,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.ud__menu-normal-submenu.ud__menu-normal-submenu-disabled .navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item__icon svg path{fill:var(--text-disabled)}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.moremenu-with-scrollbar{overflow-y:auto;padding-right:0}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3.moremenu-with-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{display:block}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-item,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-submenu{align-items:center;height:32px;min-height:28px}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-item .ud__menu-normal-item-title-content,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-item .ud__menu-normal-submenu-title,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-submenu .ud__menu-normal-item-title-content,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-submenu .ud__menu-normal-submenu-title{align-items:center;display:flex;flex:1;height:100%}.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-item.j-navigation-bar-moremenu-item.disabled,.navigation-bar__moreMenu_v3-item.ud__menu-normal-submenu.j-navigation-bar-moremenu-item.disabled{color:var(--text-disabled)!importa