sc\":{\"de_de\":\"Erfasst Feedbacks zur Effizienz der KI-gestützten Besprechungsnotizen in Docs.\",\"en_us\":\"Collect feedback on the effectiveness of AI-enhanced meeting notes in Docs.\",\"es_es\":\"Recopila comentarios sobre la eficacia de las notas de reunión mejoradas con IA en Docs.\",\"fr_fr\":\"Recueillir des commentaires sur l'efficacité des notes de réunion améliorées par l'IA dans Docs.\",\"id_id\":\"Kumpulkan umpan balik keefektifan catatan rapat yang disempurnakan AI di Docs.\",\"it_it\":\"Raccoglie feedback sull'efficacia delle note riunione migliorate dall'IA in Docs.\",\"ja_jp\":\"Docs でのスマート議事録生成機能に関するフィードバックを収集します。\",\"ko_kr\":\"Docs에서 AI 강화 회의 메모의 효과에 대한 피드백을 수집합니다.\",\"ms_my\":\"Kumpul maklum balas keberkesanan nota mesyuarat bertambah baik dengan AI di Docs.\",\"pt_br\":\"Colete feedback sobre a eficácia das anotações da reunião aprimoradas por IA no Docs.\",\"ru_ru\":\"Соберите отзывы о полезности протоколов конференций, создаваемых при помощи ИИ в Docs.\",\"th_th\":\"รวบรวมข้อเสนอแนะเกี่ยวกับประสิทธิผลของบันทึกการประชุมที่เสริมประสิทธิภาพด้วย AI ใน Docs\",\"vi_vn\":\"Thu thập phản hồi về hiệu quả của ghi chú cuộc họp nâng cao nhờ AI trong Docs.\",\"zh_cn\":\"用于收集文档中智能会议纪要的效果反馈\",\"zh_hk\":\"用於收集文件中智能會議記錄的效果意見反映\",\"zh_tw\":\"用於收集文件中智慧會議記錄的效果意見反應\"},\"descImage\":{\"de_de\":\"\",\"en_us\":\"\",\"es_es\":\"\",\"fr_fr\":\"\",\"id_id\":\"\",\"it_it\":\"\",\"ja_jp\":\"\",\"ko_kr\":\"\",\"ms_my\":\"\",\"pt_br\":\"\",\"ru_ru\":\"\",\"th_th\":\"\",\"vi_vn\":\"\",\"zh_cn\":\"\",\"zh_hk\":\"\",\"zh_tw\":\"\"},\"helpInfo\":{\"en_us\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"暂无\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/368497928122\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://p3-img.feishucdn.com/img/tos-cn-i-0000/103503b9f8fd4dceaadea591718073c5~cs_1600x1000_q80.png\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"ja_jp\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"暂无\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/368497928122\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://p3-img.feishucdn.com/img/tos-cn-i-0000/1035