6da8fg\",\"ja_jp\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_c560460f-ef55-4054-afc6-25eeb487850g\",\"zh_cn\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2ebc6f15-a676-4dcf-97e5-6366ad9a039g\"},\"helpInfo\":{\"en_us\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"Lingo is an online encyclopedia product that efficiently collects all types of information in the organization and can be edited by all organization members.\\n\\n- Connect organization information: Lingo organizes and compiles topic-specific information including definitions, documents, links, help desks, groups, contacts and more\\n- Accelerate knowledge flow: from \\\"looking for knowledge\\\" to \\\"visited by knowledge\\\", organization members can quickly discover \\\"entries\\\" in chats, documents and search results\\n- Build knowledge network: intelligent algorithms help to suggest and connect more related knowledge to accelerate knowledge update, and build up organization knowledge network\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/855025407592\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_25336752-0f18-4912-9422-b32801f86b5g\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_31ef62de-2bbf-455f-8f72-f6fa999f998g\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_69a2e3ae-68b7-49b8-9fc9-f55a3d22a93g\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_0d1772f2-faeb-467a-ad78-5d7c6fcd015g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"ja_jp\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"Lingo is an online encyclopedia product that efficiently collects all types of information in the organization and can be edited by all organization members.\\n\\n- Connect organization information: Lingo organizes and compiles topic-specific information including definitions, documents, links, help desks, groups, contacts and more\\n- Accelerate knowledge flow: from \\\"looking for knowledge\\\" to \\\"visited by knowledge\\\", organization members can quickly discover \\\"entries\\\" in chats, documents and search results\\n- Build knowledge network: intelligent algorithms help to suggest and connect more related knowledge to accelerate knowledge update, and build up organization knowledge network\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/855025407592\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_fb639e01-1d0d-41e2-ad5f-92d0fc140fag\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_66c315a6-098f-4ad1-8881-5fce48d76dag\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_d3b90f24-04aa-48fa-a632-227e01c1b46g\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_dd914c14-8522-40e4-9be1-9d5feeeff2bg\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"zh_cn\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"飞书词典是一款高效汇聚企业内各类信息，并可由企业成员参与编辑的在线词典。\\n\\n- 连接企业信息：词典将特定主题的解释说明、文档、链接、服务台、群组、联系人等信息组织汇集\\n- 加速知识流动：从“人找知识”到“知识找人”，成员可以在聊天、文档、搜索时快速发现“词条”\\n- 编织知识网络：智能推荐算法帮助推荐、关联更多企业知识，加速知识更新，构建企业知识网络\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/855025407592\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_6dc328be-cde1-4676-8100-37c52e0058fg\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_6d0a4435-03b3-48b2-9187-8b7f7d04f18g\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_acae233f-3739-4197-8845-29fc95be93ag\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_0796f9d9-239d-4322-830e-4abd59ff4b7g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]}},\"mobileIcon\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_49be454a-c13f-4de7-8e8c-023efa08dfbg\",\"name\":{\"en_us\":\"Glossary\",\"ja_jp\":\"用語集\",\"zh_cn\":\"名词解释\"},\"pcIcon\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_28954628-65c3-431b-8614-7d36b77c251g\"},{\"appId\":\"cli_a0c7750472f8500e\",\"appName\":{\"en_us\":\"Lingo\",\"ja_jp\":\"Lingo\",\"zh_cn\":\"词典\"},\"appSceneType\":1,\"blockTypeId\":\"blk_604dc919d3c080014ce141c7\",\"category\":\"docx_extension\",\"contactInfo\":{\"customApp\":{},\"isvApp\":{\"contactDetail\":{\"corpName\":\"\