ey delivery steps and delivery content are highlighted, allowing all project staff to get a clear view of the project\\n- Precisely highlight problems to promote problem-solving: Key problematic steps and solutions are reviewed in project review meetings\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/429331890039\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_05327bc9-84ae-48dd-b8c8-f9fb564c5e2g\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_7b1074cf-6a3a-4031-8e99-aa6c1d95a2dg\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"ja_jp\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"「タイムライン」を使うと、時間や手順、優先順位などを図にして表わすことが可能です。さらに事の経緯やマイルストーン、キーポイントなども可視化されます。生き生きとした表現を効率的に作成可能であるだけでなく、読者からしても、メリハリがついて、飽きることなく読み進めることができるでしょう。\\n\\n- 重要な情報を効率的に提示：節目の年や出来事を、一目瞭然な形で表現できます\\n- キーノードを強調表示：重要な納品時間や納品物を、プロジェクトに関わる全員に直感的に示せます\\n- 問題を精確に見せ、解決を加速：いつどんな問題が起きたか、どうやって解決したか、といった内容も反省会で簡単に振り返ることができます\\n- 豊富なビューをご用意：さまざまなビューが用意されており、ニーズに合わせて自由に選択できます\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/articles/429331890039\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_c29df7fa-92ea-4156-a5db-2f9f9e3ad48g\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_7e2807ab-900a-4af4-8b6c-f2c6a35211dg\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"zh_cn\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"时间轴应用，图形化地按时间、步骤、顺序表达项目和事件的发展进程、里程碑、关键点等内容。帮助文档编辑者高效生动表达，阅读者高效愉悦阅读。\\n\\n- 高效展示关键信息：将关键年份和大事记表现出来，用户一目了然\\n- 重点提示关键节点：向项目全员清晰说明关键的时间交付节点及交付内容\\n- 精准凸显问题促解决：项目复盘会中，回顾关键的问题节点及解决方案\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/429331890039\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_8f5e2981-ec0e-4abe-af4c-6167473d0b0g\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_7f11ba7d-05d9-4bdd-aec9-23bc9c817d6g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]}},\"mobileIcon\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_f4e9735d-6ab7-4257-a6d4-d90cd0067d7g\",\"name\":{\"en_us\":\"Timer\",\"ja_jp\":\"カウントダウン\",\"zh_cn\":\"倒计时\",\"zh_hk\":\"倒計時\",\"zh_tw\":\"倒計時\"},\"pcIcon\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_f4e9735d-6ab7-4257-a6d4-d90cd0067d7g\"},{\"appId\":\"cli_a3f843f777b81013\",\"appName\":{\"en_us\":\"Batch Formatter\",\"ja_jp\":\"書式の一括設定\",\"zh_cn\":\"批量格式设置\",\"zh_hk\":\"大量設定格式\",\"zh_tw\":\"批次設定格式\"},\"appSceneType\":1,\"blockTypeId\":\"blk_6372ffead680c01c498eca40\",\"category\":\"docx_extension\",\"contactInfo\":{\"customApp\":{},\"isvApp\":{\"contactDetail\":{\"corpName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"email\":\"support@feishu.cn\",\"i18nAgreement\":{\"en_us\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/en/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/en/privacy\"},\"ja_jp\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"},\"zh_cn\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"}},\"officialUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/\",\"phone\":\"400-0682-666\"},\"i18nIsvInfo\":{\"I18nTenantName\":{},\"TenantName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"avatarURL\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2cab041c-1c0d-4e8f-81c8-cbdc1b7763ag~?image_size=noop\\u0026cut_type=\\u0026quality=\\u0026format=image\\u0026sticker_format=.webp\"}}},\"desc\":{\"en_us\":\"Enable the tool and select body text for quick formatting\",\"ja_jp\":\"ツールを使って、選択中のテキストにすばやくスタイルを適用\",\"zh_cn\":\"启用工具后，选中正文文字即可快速设置格式\",\"zh_hk\":\"啟用工具後，選取正文文字即可快速設定格式\",\"zh_tw\":\"啟用工具後，選取內文文字即可快速設定格式\"},\"descImage\":{\"en_us\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_0dfbd149-b57f-4767-ba5f-3d7f6bfd6fbg\",\"ja_jp\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_95dcdbfa-4dc9-4db1-856f-e278c735444g\",\"zh_cn\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2dbdf120-bf96-4598-b1eb-2cdd555cfbbg\",\"zh_hk\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_d744c007-bae1-4024-8b70-f6fccea51d0g\",\"zh_tw\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_d41973fd-3eb7-44e1-9710-cc027f5ce44g\"},\"helpInfo\":{\"en_us\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"Up to 13 types of text formats such as BIUS, text color, and alignment mode are available for quick formatting. You can simply use the \\\"Brush\\\" tool to apply the format you have set, increasing your writing efficiency.\\n\\n- An efficiency tool for document creation: After you set a format, you can apply it multiple times. This helps you adjust text formats efficiently and save your time in writing documents\\n- A variety of formats are supported: Up to 13 types of text formats such as BIUS, text color, and alignment mode are available for quick formatting\\n- Easy to operate: You can apply a new format to text in just two steps\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/591902762640\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_8ec1ffbb-febc-4f1c-96e6-b0f615d52fbg\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_febf459c-60e4-48bb-b483-b78c4de5b55g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"ja_jp\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"太字・斜体・下線・取り消し線などの文字装飾、文字の色、文字揃えなど、13 種類までのフォーマットは速やかに設定できます。書式ブラシでなぞれば、すぐさま反映されるで、文書の作成効率が大幅に上昇します。\\n\\n- 文書作成の効率化：書式を 1 度設定すれば、何度でも利用可能なので、書式を整える時間の削減が可能です\\n- 各種フォーマットに対応：太字・斜体・下線・取り消し線などの文字装飾、文字の色、文字揃えなど、13 種類までのフォーマットは速やかに設定できます\\n- 慣れるのも楽々：テキストに違うフォーマットを適用するには、たった 2 つのステップで OK です\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/articles/591902762640\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_56919124-aadb-4350-a9e7-ca1ec3f0b03g\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_21db25a2-47eb-49f5-9086-4eeacb6ddbdg\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"zh_cn\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"支持快速设置 BIUS、字体颜色、对齐方式等多达 13 种文字格式，“刷一刷”即可快速应用设置好的格式，助你写作事半功倍\\n\\n- 文档创作的效率工具：一次设置、多次应用，帮助你高效调整文字格式，节约文档写作时间\\n- 支持丰富的格式设置：支持快速设置 BIUS、字体颜色、对齐方式等多达 13 种文字格式\\n- 上手低门槛：只需两步，即可对文字应用新格式\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/591902762640\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_37171296-55bf-48cc-b9d2-25cf7073a40g\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_302b65b7-7714-4d03-92ba-9e9a352d9ceg\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]}},\"mobileIcon\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_d455b18c-f7a2-45bf-a6df-ee22635e615g\",\"name\":{\"en_us\":\"Batch Formatter\",\"ja_jp\":\"書式の一括設定\",\"zh_cn\":\"批量格式设置\",\"zh_hk\":\"大量設定格式\",\"zh_tw\":\"批次設定格式\"},\"pcIcon\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_f0683778-f7e7-483a-bb4d-4da05195a06g\"},{\"appId\":\"cli_a3f983253dbd500b\",\"appName\":{\"en_us\":\"Typesetter\",\"ja_jp\":\"文字書式チェック\",\"zh_cn\":\"文字排版助手\",\"zh_hk\":\"文字排版助手\",\"zh_tw\":\"文字版面配置助手\"},\"appSceneType\":1,\"blockTypeId\":\"blk_63733f389c858004038b896a\",\"category\":\"docx_extension\",\"contactInfo\":{\"customApp\":{},\"isvApp\":{\"contactDetail\":{\"corpName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"email\":\"support@feishu.cn\",\"i18nAgreement\":{\"en_us\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/en/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/en/privacy\"},\"ja_jp\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"},\"zh_cn\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"}},\"officialUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn\",\"phone\":\"400-0682-666\"},\"i18nIsvInfo\":{\"I18nTenantName\":{},\"TenantName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"avatarURL\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2cab041c-1c0d-4e8f-81c8-cbdc1b7763ag~?image_size=noop\\u0026cut_type=\\u0026quality=\\u0026format=image\\u0026sticker_format=.webp\"}}},\"desc\":{\"en_us\":\"Check formatting issues in your documents and optimize them with one click\",\"ja_jp\":\"ドキュメント内のスタイルのバラつきを検出して、ワンクリックで修正\",\"zh_cn\":\"检测文档内格式问题并一键优化\\n\",\"zh_hk\":\"偵測文件內格式問題並一鍵最佳化\",\"zh_tw\":\"偵測文件內格式問題並一鍵最佳化\"},\"descImage\":{\"en_us\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2d4fb695-a466-43ca-a2e0-a57011c421cg\",\"ja_jp\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_ba4505bb-ad92-435d-8422-15374becdc6g\",\"zh_cn\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_36e5477e-abdd-43f0-b7dd-97b71fd4e18g\",\"zh_hk\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_9852b70b-2034-40ae-9d5e-b9de5e68b56g\",\"zh_tw\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_3b9c49fe-9d3a-4dbb-b3cc-5763d33e49bg\"},\"helpInfo\":{\"en_us\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"This intelligent formatting correction assistant can detect formatting issues (spaces between Chinese and English characters, spaces between numbers and Chinese characters, full-width and half-width characters, etc.) and optimize them with one click, thus improving your work efficiency.\\n\\n- An efficiency improvement assistant for copywriters: Automatic check and batch and case-by-case correction are supported, helping save your time and effort and solve your document format standardization issues accurately and efficiently\\n- A standardization assistant for formal documents: The format correction feature helps eliminate formatting issues from formal documents such as report documents, research reports, and user guides\\n- Support for common formatting rules: Currently, the supported formatting rules include required spaces between Chinese and English characters, required spaces between numbers and Chinese characters, no space required between numbers and degree and percentage symbols, and consistent punctuation in Chinese and English contexts. More rules are on the way\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/317905737314\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_c82e5543-d89f-467a-b271-2e7231035cdg\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_4d54697b-db1a-4735-bc74-69a27ceca02g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"ja_jp\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"レイアウト上の誤り（全角・半角記号など）をワンクリックで解決できるため、業務効率のアップにつながります。\\n\\n- 表記ゆれをすばやくチェック：誤りを自動的に検出し、一括で修正が可能です（逐一の修正も可）。ドキュメントのフォーマット上の問題をすばやく効率的に解決すれば、時間も労力も減らすことができます\\n- 下書きの清書やフォーマットの統一に役立つ：レポート、調査研究報告書、マニュアルなど、正式なものが求められる文書では、フォーマットを訂正することで、悩みを解決できます\\n- よくあるフォーマットルールに対応：現在、対応可能な機能は下記の通りです。① 日本語と英語／数字間のスペースがあることの確認。 ②「℃」や「％」の前にスペースがないことの確認。 ③ 日本語・英語両方が存在する場合に、記号をいずれかに統一\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/articles/317905737314\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_ad4b356b-362f-4bf8-a3fa-bcfa5b5f1a1g\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_6627ea42-422a-4e74-9668-c22735a1695g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"zh_cn\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"你的智能格式纠正助手，检测格式问题（中英空格、中数空格、全角半角符号等），一键优化，提升你的工作效率。\\n\\n- 文案工作者的提效助手：自动校验、支持批量和逐个纠正，省时省力，帮助你精准高效解决文档格式规范问题\\n- 正式文档的规范助手：汇报文档、调研报告、帮助手册等较为正式的文档，格式纠正帮助你解决格式问题\\n- 支持常见的格式规则：目前包含中英空格、中数空格、度和百分比不空格、中英语境下标点保持一致，后续规则迭代也值得期待\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/317905737314\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_6b653b67-5c17-4182-bee8-df09c90ee64g\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_635115dc-4c03-490e-bdfa-64c3a5c6519g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]}},\"mobileIcon\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_bf23cd1e-a002-4897-9ded-61816789c8dg\",\"name\":{\"en_us\":\"Typesetter\",\"ja_jp\":\"文字書式チェック\",\"zh_cn\":\"文字排版助手\",\"zh_hk\":\"文字排版助手\",\"zh_tw\":\"文字版面配置助手\"},\"pcIcon\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_5f69d3ff-8206-4876-ac21-ec7d9bede41g\"},{\"appId\":\"cli_a3f7707424af9013\",\"appName\":{\"en_us\":\"Table of Contents\",\"ja_jp\":\"目次ナビゲーション\",\"zh_cn\":\"目录导航\",\"zh_hk\":\"目錄導覽\",\"zh_tw\":\"目錄導覽\"},\"appSceneType\":1,\"blockTypeId\":\"blk_637dcc698597401c1a8fd711\",\"category\":\"docx_extension\",\"contactInfo\":{\"customApp\":{},\"isvApp\":{\"contactDetail\":{\"corpName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"email\":\"support@feishu.cn\",\"i18nAgreement\":{\"en_us\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/en/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/en/privacy\"},\"ja_jp\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"},\"zh_cn\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"}},\"officialUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/\",\"phone\":\"400-0682-666\"},\"i18nIsvInfo\":{\"I18nTenantName\":{},\"TenantName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"avatarURL\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2cab041c-1c0d-4e8f-81c8-cbdc1b7763ag~?image_size=noop\\u0026cut_type=\\u0026quality=\\u0026format=image\\u0026sticker_format=.webp\"}}},\"desc\":{\"en_us\":\"Add a table of contents to show the main points clearly and see each level of headings listed\",\"ja_jp\":\"本文に階層目次を挿入でき、表示する見出しレベルも自由自在\",\"zh_cn\":\"在正文插入可筛选层级的目录\\n\",\"zh_hk\":\"在正文插入可篩選層級的目錄\",\"zh_tw\":\"在內文插入可篩選層級的目錄\"},\"descImage\":{\"en_us\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_4435b7ed-3656-4529-8ec9-fd6c993733fg\",\"ja_jp\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2740491b-4b89-4c2d-bc38-befd74fe622g\",\"zh_cn\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_5ba115ee-17fb-40f4-90ca-1cb02d9a81ag\",\"zh_hk\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_0429b646-d457-4470-8e0f-c16605552fcg\",\"zh_tw\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_314e4302-b4b5-4d8d-837d-fe2e2605dceg\"},\"helpInfo\":{\"en_us\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"By inserting the \\\"Navigation menu\\\" app into your document, you can insert a table of contents into the body text of your document, filter headings at a specific level, and hide headings. This helps editors better present the structure of an article to readers and guide the readers to the content they want.\\n\\n- More efficient reading: You can filter content by heading levels, guiding readers to key topics.\\n- More diverse expressions: You can switch between a directory tree and a mind map with one click.\\n-Clearer guidance: You can insert a table of contents into the body text of a document, making long documents clearer.\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/508843291189\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_b7cf9c9d-9c6b-41b5-b2d5-bf3a533fc6eg\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_4d63697e-8f32-46ef-a0c0-4176e87485cg\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"ja_jp\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"ドキュメントに「目次ナビゲーション」を適用すると、本文に目次が挿入されます。表示する見出しレベルや一部の見出しを非表示にする機能も揃っており、作り手の思うままに文章構造を可視化することができます。これにより、読者の注意を文章のポイントに惹きつけやすくなります。\\n\\n- 閲覧を効率的に：見出しレベルを選択可能で、ポイントとなる部分を読者に提示できます\\n- 豊かな表現力：ツリー表示とマインドマップ表示がワンクリックで切り替えられます\\n- 文章構造を明確に：目次を挿入することで、長い文章でも構造を明確に理解できます\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/articles/508843291189\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_1378f49e-274f-4b71-8cb7-f59b52b8f0eg\",\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_582beacf-ea48-4d4b-8b5c-4eecfe126c5g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"zh_cn\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"在文档中插入一个“目录导航”应用，为用户实现将目录插入文档正文、筛选特定等级标题、隐藏标题的功能，帮助编辑者更好地向读者传递文章结构信息，清晰指引你的读者需要他们重点关注的内容。\\n\\n- 更高效的阅读：可筛选标题层级，引导你的读者阅读重点章节\\n- 更丰富的表达：目录树与思维导图一键切换\\n- 更清晰的指引：将目录插入正文中，长文档结构更清晰\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/508843291189\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_c98e1110-d70c-4e8e-8d9a-d876adf7461g\",\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_1f4fd128-f6a7-4121-8abc-a446df7f02ag\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]}},\"mobileIcon\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_a4167c21-861e-48eb-8b6f-cda4527a197g\",\"name\":{\"en_us\":\"Table of Contents\",\"ja_jp\":\"目次ナビゲーション\",\"zh_cn\":\"目录导航\",\"zh_hk\":\"目錄導覽\",\"zh_tw\":\"目錄導覽\"},\"pcIcon\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_da7929f8-da80-4e01-ab5d-2c1fbd86f10g\"},{\"appId\":\"cli_a32ab0697b38100d\",\"appName\":{\"en_us\":\"Translator\",\"zh_cn\":\"飞书快译\"},\"appSceneType\":1,\"blockTypeId\":\"blk_63a00c74da00c002453a1760\",\"category\":\"docx_extension\",\"contactInfo\":{\"customApp\":{},\"isvApp\":{\"contactDetail\":{\"corpName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"email\":\"support@feishu.cn\",\"i18nAgreement\":{\"en_us\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"},\"zh_cn\":{\"clauseUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/terms\",\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/privacy\"}},\"officialUrl\":\"https://open.feishu.cn/\",\"phone\":\"400-0682-666\"},\"i18nIsvInfo\":{\"I18nTenantName\":{},\"TenantName\":\"北京飞书科技有限公司\",\"avatarURL\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_2cab041c-1c0d-4e8f-81c8-cbdc1b7763ag~?image_size=noop\\u0026cut_type=\\u0026quality=\\u0026format=image\\u0026sticker_format=.webp\"}}},\"desc\":{\"en_us\":\"Translate selected text in real-time.\",\"zh_cn\":\"实时翻译选中文本\"},\"descImage\":{\"en_us\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_b4d620c6-7af4-4bdb-9cf9-2207bbab08eg\",\"zh_cn\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_7786ab44-5382-4709-a40d-d1e4bde5b08g\"},\"helpInfo\":{\"en_us\":{\"additionalRemark\":\" Translaor helps you translate quickly in Feishu, solve language barriers and improve communication efficiency.\\n- Use  Translaor , with one click or selecting words, the operation is simple and barrier-free\\n- No need to jump out of Feishu, solve translation problems smoothly in doc\\n- Provide 10 + languages, covering common languages\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/en-US/articles/280042323002\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_20200979-f9ba-49ad-b200-3ecc8a74f34g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]},\"zh_cn\":{\"additionalRemark\":\"飞书快译，帮助你在飞书中快速进行翻译，解决语言障碍，提高沟通效率。\\n- 直接使用飞书快译进行翻译，只需简单划选或点击，操作简单无障碍\\n- 无需跳出飞书，在文档内丝滑解决翻译问题\\n- 提供了10+种语言供选择，覆盖常用语种\",\"helpUse\":\"https://www.feishu.cn/hc/zh-CN/articles/280042323002\",\"snapshotImages\":[\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_171be4ed-420d-4849-a1a9-b045a77d154g\"],\"snapshotVideos\":[]}},\"mobileIcon\":\"https://s1-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_fa124053-c5c1-464f-921c-2a467482649g\",\"name\":{\"en_us\":\"Translator\",\"zh_cn\":\"飞书快译\"},\"pcIcon\":\"https://s3-imfile.feishucdn.com/static-resource/v1/v2_998f8537-473f-43ba-bfe7-bb868460f20g\"}]},\"msg\":\"\"}"
